                  ORG 100

Loop,             Load        ArrayCellIndex   
                  Subt        Five
                  Skipcond    000              / check if i < 5
                  Jump        EndLoop

                  Load        ArrayBaseAddress
                  Add         ArrayCellIndex
                  Store       ArrayCellAddress / new address of a[i]
  
                  Load        Sum
                  AddI        ArrayCellAddress
                  Store       Sum              / sum = sum + a[i]

                  /LoadI       ArrayCellAddress
                  /Add         Sum
                  /Store       Sum             / sum = sum + a[i]

                  Load        ArrayCellIndex
                  Add         One
                  Store       ArrayCellIndex   / i++

                  Jump        Loop

EndLoop,          Load  Sum
                  Output
                  Halt

                  Dec         10               / a[0]
                  Dec         15               / a[1]
                  Dec         20               / a[2]
                  Dec         25               / a[3]
                  Dec         30               / a[4]
ArrayBaseAddress, Hex         111              / address of a[0]
ArrayCellAddress, Hex         000              / address of a[i]
ArrayCellIndex,   Dec         0                / index i
Sum,              Dec         0                / sum
One,              Dec         1                / constant 1
Five,             Dec         5                / constant 5
